# Implementation Plan - Phase 1: Data & Infrastructure Design

# Goal Description
Define the core data models, cloud infrastructure as code (IaC), and API specifications for Spendigo SmartCart. This establishes the "hard constraints" for the system: strict relational schema, Canada-first deployment, and explicit API contracts.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Database Schema**:
> - **Stores**: Multi-tenant architecture considerations.
> - **Products**: Store-specific inventory vs. Global catalog.
> - **Orders**: Split-payment support (`transfer_group`).

> [!WARNING]
> **Terraform State**:
> We will use local state for now (`terraform.tfstate`) to avoid S3 backend costs initially, but will document how to migrate to a remote backend.

